WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A word appears in the wrong color. You know what it says. But try naming the ink.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In the laboratory, that hesitation has a name: the Stroop effect.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Researchers found that certain suggestions changed this conflict for certain volunteers.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Other protocols found different limits. Instructions are not all interchangeable.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Now ask the question every focus-audio buyer deserves: was the actual recording tested?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Keep the wonder. Check the evidence. Read Final Vestige's independent guide.
